From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AkaraChen <akarachen@outlook.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 09:30:10 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] acpc: agent switching, session options and sign-in

/agent picks one of the configured ACP agents and starts a new session
with it. /options lists the agent's session config options and modes;
Shift+Tab cycles the mode. The switch request is not awaited on the app
loop, so the bridge can ask the user to pick a sign-in method
(acpc/auth/select) and run a terminal sign-in command with the TUI's
terminal (acpc/terminal/run) while it is pending.
